<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Navlog {{ origin }} → {{ destination }}</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4 landscape; margin: 10mm 10mm 14mm 10mm;
    @bottom-left  { content: "{{ page_footer }}"; font: 7pt Arial, sans-serif; color: #555; }
    @bottom-right { content: "page " counter(page) " / " counter(pages); font: 7pt Arial, sans-serif; color: #555; }
  }
  html { font-size: 10pt; }
  body { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #000; background: #fff; margin: 0; line-height: 1.3; }
  @media screen { html { background: #ececec; } body { max-width: 1400px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 24px 28px; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.15); } }

  h1 { font-size: 15pt; margin: 0 0 2mm; color: #12232e; letter-spacing: .5px; }
  .facts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5mm 6mm; margin: 0 0 3mm; font-size: 9pt; }
  .fact b { display: block; font-size: 7pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; color: #555; font-weight: 600; }
  .mono { font-family: "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 8.5pt; }
  th, td { border: .5pt solid #999; padding: 1.3mm 1.6mm; text-align: center; }
  th { background: #12232e; color: #fff; font-size: 7pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .4px; }
  td.left { text-align: left; }
  td.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cap { font-weight: 700; font-size: 10pt; background: #eef2f6; }
  .totals td { font-weight: 700; background: #f0f0f0; border-top: 1.5pt solid #000; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #fafafa; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) td.cap { background: #e6edf3; }

  .disclaimer { margin-top: 4mm; padding-top: 2mm; border-top: 1.2pt solid #000; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #333; }
  .disclaimer b { color: #b3261e; }
  .warn { color: #b3261e; font-weight: 700; }
</style>

<h1>LOG DE NAVIGATION — {{ origin }} → {{ destination }}</h1>
<div class="facts">
  <div class="fact"><b>Aéronef</b><span class="mono">{{ aircraft_name }}</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Départ prévu</b><span class="mono">{{ departure_dual }}</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Arrivée estimée</b><span class="mono">{{ arrival_dual }}</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>TAS croisière</b><span class="mono">{{ tas_kt }} kt</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Conso</b><span class="mono">{{ fuel_flow_lph }} L/h</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Déclinaison</b><span class="mono">{{ mag_var_label }}</span></div>
  <div class="fact"><b>Total</b><span class="mono">{{ total_distance }} NM · {{ total_time }} · {{ total_fuel }}</span></div>
</div>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>#</th><th>Branche</th><th>Alt<br>(ft)</th><th>Rv</th><th>Vent<br>(alt)</th>
      <th>Dérive</th><th class="cap">Cap<br>mag</th><th>Rm</th><th>Dist<br>(NM)</th>
      <th>Vs<br>(kt)</th><th>Temps</th><th>Passage</th><th>Conso<br>(L)</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for r in rows %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
      <td class="left mono">{{ r.branch }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.altitude }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.true_track }}</td>
      <td class="mono">{{ r.wind }}</td>
      <td>{{ r.drift }}</td>
      <td class="cap">{{ r.magnetic_heading }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.magnetic_track }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.distance }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.ground_speed }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.time }}</td>
      <td class="mono">{{ r.passage }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.fuel }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    <tr class="totals">
      <td colspan="8" class="left">TOTAL</td>
      <td class="num">{{ total_distance }}</td>
      <td></td>
      <td class="num">{{ total_time }}</td>
      <td class="mono">{{ arrival_local }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ total_fuel }}</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p class="disclaimer">
  <b>AIDE À LA PRÉPARATION — ne remplace pas le calcul officiel ni le jugement du commandant de bord.</b><br>
  Route et cap en degrés ; <b>cap magnétique = cap vrai − déclinaison</b> ({{ mag_var_label }}, à confirmer sur la carte).
  Vent en altitude interpolé à l'altitude de branche — source <b>Open-Meteo</b> (modèle GFS/ARPEGE), échantillonné à l'heure de départ.
  <span class="warn">TAS et conso PROVISOIRES</span> (valeurs typiques DR400/160, pas encore tirées du manuel F-GGJY).
  Heures locales = {{ display_timezone }} · Z entre parenthèses. Généré le {{ generated_dual }}.
</p>
